{"type":"message","id":"74975c51","parentId":"a90d5623","timestamp":"2026-03-12T16:26:58.450Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a subagent task for QA (Quality Assurance) role. The task is clear:\n\n1. I need to acknowledge the task adjustment\n2. Wait for PM (胡小产) to produce PRD (Product Requirement Document)\n3. Then supplement test cases based on PRD\n4. Focus on backend API testing\n5. Push test reports to GitHub repository HYCGITCODE/todo-calendar\n\nThe task asks me to reply with a specific message once ready: \"QA 已知晓，等待 PM 需求文档后补充测试用例\"\n\nThis is straightforward - I just need to acknowledge and confirm I understand the task. No complex actions needed.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"QA 已知晓，等待 PM 需求文档后补充测试用例。\n\n**任务确认摘要**：\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **角色** | QA 胡小测 |\n| **当前状态** | 待命（等待 PRD） |\n| **核心调整** | 测试用例需在 PM 产出 PRD 后补充完善 |\n| **测试重点** | 后端 API 测试（BE 已加入项目） |\n| **目标仓库** | HYCGITCODE/todo-calendar |\n\n**后续行动计划**：\n\n1. ⏳ 等待 PM 胡小产输出 PRD 文档\n2. 📋 根据 PRD 补充和完善测试用例\n3. 🔌 准备后端 API 测试方案\n4. 📊 准备数据验证测试\n5. 📤 测试报告推送至 GitHub 仓库\n\n当前已准备的测试用例将作为基础基线，待 PRD 到位后进行扩展和细化。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"dashscope-coding","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":20046,"output":492,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20538,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773332767547}}
